* sg13g2-ldo -- HBT screening corner bundles (issue #139).
*
* klt sim takes ONE models.lib per request and selects one named section per
* corner; the PDK ships the HBT process corners as sections of its own
* cornerHBT.lib (hbt_bcs / hbt_typ / hbt_wcs). Each section below is one named
* corner that selects the matching PDK section. The PDK file is NOT edited,
* only selected. $PDK_ROOT is expanded on the SUBMITTING host (run_sweep.sh
* exports it); the client stages the files and their .include closure with the
* job (options.stage_model_inputs) and the report pins each staged file's
* sha256 in environment.staged_model_inputs.
*
* bcs / wcs are the PDK's own best/worst-case-speed HBT corners (VBIC: Is, Ibei,
* resistances, caps scaled together; pnpMPA: is, bf, re, rb, rc, caps). The
* statistical (_stat) and mismatch sections are NOT used here: this is a
* deterministic corner screen. Temperature is the klt sim axis.
.lib bcs
.lib "$PDK_ROOT/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerHBT.lib" hbt_bcs
.endl bcs
.lib typ
.lib "$PDK_ROOT/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerHBT.lib" hbt_typ
.endl typ
.lib wcs
.lib "$PDK_ROOT/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerHBT.lib" hbt_wcs
.endl wcs
